sequenceDiagram
  participant B as BrowserShell
  participant PR as PanelRegistry
  participant I as IframePanel
  participant RPC as PanelProtocol
  participant A as ApiClient
  participant H as HttpServer
  participant R as ConsoleRoutes
  participant D as KernelDeps
  participant BUS as Bus

  B->>H: GET / (shell)
  B->>PR: register and mount(sessions)
  PR->>I: load iframe panel
  I->>B: postMessage panel.ready
  B->>RPC: validate origin and source
  I->>B: RPC api.request GET /api/sessions
  B->>A: request(GET, path)
  A->>H: fetch with x-console-token
  H->>R: dispatch guarded route
  R->>D: SessionRegistry.listSummaries()
  D-->>R: sessions[]
  R-->>A: JSON result
  A-->>B: RPC response
  B-->>I: postMessage response

  BUS-->>H: session.update event
  H-->>B: SSE event frame
  B-->>I: event.session-update notification

  I->>B: RPC api.request GET /api/chats/key/messages
  B->>A: request(GET, path)
  A->>H: GET messages
  H->>R: ChatStore.recent()
  R-->>I: messages response
  I->>B: RPC api.request POST /api/chats/key/mark-read
  B->>A: request(POST, path)
  A->>H: guarded request
  H->>R: ChatStore.markAllRead()
  R-->>I: {ok:true, marked:N}

  I->>B: RPC api.request POST /api/skills/id
  B->>A: request(POST, path)
  A->>H: guarded request
  H->>R: PluginLoader.setEnabled()
  R-->>I: skill status

  B->>PR: unmount(sessions)
  PR->>I: remove iframe and listeners
